      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax-H3 Fun ControlNet Union: Canny\n\nThe control video is built inside the workflow: **Load Video** -> fit to 1344x768 -> first 124 frames -> **Canny** -> **Create Video** (24 FPS) -> **MiniMax-H3 Control** -> **Generate Video**. Check the saved control video and tune the Canny thresholds; lower values keep more edges. For `depth`, `hed`, `mlsd` or `pose`, replace **Canny** with the matching preprocessor and change `control_type`.\n\n**Server:** an FL2VA server started with `--controlnet-model-path`, as in the Fun ControlNet Union section of `recipes/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3.md`. Set `url` and `model` for your server. **MiniMax-H3 Video Params** stays connected, so a custom `--served-model-name` is still recognised as MiniMax-H3.\n\n**Defaults:** 40 steps, guidance 1.0, video flow 12, audio flow 3, seed 43; 1344x768, 24 FPS, duration 5.167 s = 124 frames.\n\nControl cannot be combined with `frame`, `first_frame`/`last_frame`, `references` or `latent_edit`. The Load Video filename is a placeholder: put your source clip in `ComfyUI/input`.\n"
      ]
    }
